cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software artifact, please cite both the artifact
  (this file) and the paper it accompanies (preferred-citation below).
type: software
title: >-
  AgentOrchPatterns: reproducibility package for "A Pattern Catalog for
  Multi-Agent Generative AI Orchestration Across Enterprise CRM and
  Hyperscaler Cloud Platforms"
abstract: >-
  Executable reproducibility package: seven multi-agent orchestration
  patterns instantiated against locally mocked Salesforce Agentforce
  360 and Amazon Bedrock/AgentCore clients, with a deterministic
  open-loop measurement rig, a 336-cell fault-injection campaign, a
  cost model, and a pre-committed statistics pipeline regenerating all
  tables and figures of the accompanying IEEE Access submission.
authors:
  - family-names: Goel
    given-names: Shikher
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0005-8392-0949"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-06-04"
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/shikher20goel/multi-agent-genai-orchestration-patterns"
keywords:
  - multi-agent systems
  - generative AI
  - orchestration patterns
  - software architecture
  - reproducibility
  - Salesforce Agentforce
  - Amazon Bedrock
preferred-citation:
  type: article
  title: >-
    A Pattern Catalog for Multi-Agent Generative AI Orchestration
    Across Enterprise CRM and Hyperscaler Cloud Platforms
  authors:
    - family-names: Goel
      given-names: Shikher
